# wear/woman/poncho: the woman's poncho (STYLE_P2 22 "Poncho"; the highland and plains peoples): a wide woven drape from a slit at
# the throat over her shoulders and arms, a woven band in accent across the chest and shoulders, a lit hem at the waist; its
# sides cover her forearms (the drape parts on the arm channels) so only the hands show; a knotted fringe hangs from the hem
# (the hang) over her trousers
# GARB-W (P2b wave 2). Fitted to one body (STYLE_P2 22). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person woman
body woman
role garment poncho
layer torso
anchor neck
keys torso

